WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.100
HIPAA training. Module 6.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.533
The Security Rule: protecting electronic patient information.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.233
The Security Rule protects electronic patient information, so that

4
00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:15.333
the allowed uses are the only uses that happen.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.833
Confidentiality: only the right people can see it.

6
00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:25.933
Integrity: it has not been changed by mistake or on purpose.

7
00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:29.700
Availability: people can get to it when they need it.

8
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.233
Technical: unique logins, encryption and automatic log-off.

9
00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:39.400
Physical: protecting rooms, workstations and devices.

10
00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:43.767
Administrative: policies, training and risk analysis.

11
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.467
Find where the information is.

12
00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:49.900
Find what could go wrong.

13
00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:52.567
Rate how likely and how harmful.

14
00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:55.867
Act, and document what was decided.

15
00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.433
Your login is yours alone.

16
00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:02.500
Lock your computer when you step away.

17
00:01:02.867 --> 00:01:06.467
Report a lost or stolen device immediately.

18
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.267
Stop.

19
00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:09.667
Do not share.

20
00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:11.200
Ask your lead.

21
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.333
Now read the module.
